{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6dd4fe5cdaa4a0451cb9617c0568bab8a5e69bde0b4908bde42d5af41e17d593", "ja": "（『アイグラ！！』新企画の撮影で、海に来ている。\nそろそろ撮影が始まる時間だけど、環は……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄《偶像写真！！》的新企划，来到了海边。\n差不多要开始拍摄了，可是环她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "93967667aef9f730e3e8e13c3a2832da7f058379817374ba19c35623ed9ee5e9", "ja": "あっ！　おやぶん発見～！　あのね、\nあっちに面白いものがいっぱいあったんだ～！", "zh": "啊！发现老大～！跟你说哦，\n那边有好多有趣的东西呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e29f659870841859296d3d46ac019e9d92031c16d1144285235f1e1a3c58b050", "ja": "姿が見えないと思ったら、浜辺に行ってたのか。\n衣装のまま遊んでないよな？", "zh": "我还想你跑到哪儿去了，原来是去海滩了啊。\n没有穿着演出服去玩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "a66f47f86dcdcce113a51b350f034ca63748b389bb3786a66b7b9533034ee5e4", "ja": "うん、見てただけ！\n汚れちゃったら、お仕事できないし……。", "zh": "嗯，只是看看而已！\n要是弄脏了，就没法工作了嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "d3befbe67cc3bdfe4cb02d6b5f17fe205d9e7b4f706bc552b44e335b4a612c0d", "ja": "だってこの服、おやぶんが選んでくれたんでしょ？\nたまきの新しい服！", "zh": "因为这件衣服是大叔你帮我挑的吧？\n环的新衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "23d8d0b3ba848ebc73bfb1b250944baf930b6b16f3ce992ae5ff72e1d802275f", "ja": "だからたまき、海で遊ぶのはガマンしたんだ～。\n撮影が終わったら、いっしょに遊ぼうね！", "zh": "所以环才忍住没在海边玩～。\n拍摄结束后，一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a6ce8c5b5668743d58a5e6d729cdb0529855bcce8aec1ec90d369e3bf9bb6e98", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n衣装から着替えたら、環がやりたい事をしような。", "zh": "啊，当然。\n换好服装后，就做环想做的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "1cf643a94dbc599c612dcbbb703ba041ab26180504e55af99215d60f18437ebb", "ja": "やったー！　くふふ、何して遊ぼうかな～。\nお城作って、スイカ割りして……♪", "zh": "太好啦——！嘿嘿，玩什么好呢～\n堆城堡、打西瓜……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "0a703731fd93a46dd439d963927a0069d30f52d4cc93aa01f944d9939ab0bf36", "ja": "あと、きれいな貝がらがいっぱいあったから、\n劇場のみんなに拾っていきたい！", "zh": "而且，那边还有好多漂亮的贝壳，我想捡一些带回去送给剧场的大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "851864e0613512fb99dea1ce34da73fdc190ed0acf66af9a586c6b5fad23605c", "ja": "あとね、あっちに洞窟っぽいのもあったんだ！\n探検したら、楽しそうかも……。", "zh": "还有哦，那边好像还有个洞窟！\n要是去探险的话，感觉会很有趣呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bdc442119707f5e8cc6044226e854606595d06960c87533f2235fd5900648d57", "ja": "お、思ったよりいっぱいあるんだな！　じゃあ\nいっぱい遊ぶためにも、撮影頑張らないとな。", "zh": "哦，没想到比想象中还多啊！那为了尽情玩，也得好好加油拍摄才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1012_p", "source_sha256": "87ab069501eb451c20b3638459ebe9a16157eba349cce1b96b7b53b79ee0e71f", "ja": "環？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "环？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "2dd532c4ed08e7901f47c0e1b269fd4d11c94565a7789ec05b79135fb1037b6f", "ja": "うう……。\nうーーーーーーっ！", "zh": "呜呜……\n呜——————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4c63685aa39d12b6d5bea9b94ac88615e7c134045cbae1bf6389ec225ae89ddc", "ja": "た、環！？　どうした、気分が悪いのか？", "zh": "环！？怎么了，不舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "2f7e1e9be841521c75ec4ac1fd3af998af60c7e8a7471a34f7b72941281e11e4", "ja": "おやぶ～ん……。\nたまき、やっぱり、ガマンできない～。", "zh": "老大～……\n环果然还是忍不住了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d9a200be8b7f555f98906479dbea6dc39689c698a86711cc0ac7b5499aeedaee", "ja": "はは、そうか。でももうすぐ撮影が始まるから……\nそうだな。一緒に、貝がら拾いでもしようか。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。不过拍摄马上就要开始了……\n这样吧，我们一起捡贝壳怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "fe5bd479dfc9a866b827fef8214065861c812ad4894ff1c62f7f4b11af4318fc", "ja": "うん！　おやぶん、ありがとう！\nたまき、きれいなやつ拾うぞ～。くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！老大，谢谢你！\n环要捡漂亮的贝壳啦～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bfe6ecd889f28b8f19afeaf05d61c250bc094f7d0a55c34a162bd45efe403e05", "ja": "（成長したかと思えばまだまだ子どもだな……\nそういうところも、環の魅力として見せていきたいな）", "zh": "（还以为她成长了，没想到还是个孩子啊……我也想把这样的地方展现为环的魅力。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
